cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the article and the software."
type: software
title: "exact-lyapunov-spectra: exact Lyapunov spectra of affine cellular automata and the parity rule on networks"
abstract: "Reproducibility package: the verified maths core, figure and table scripts, computed caches and verification suite behind the article. Affine Boolean rules have a configuration-independent Boolean Jacobian, so their Lyapunov spectrum is exact: the discrete Fourier transform of the gradient stencil on a periodic lattice, and the absolute graph spectrum for the parity rule on any graph."
